+# Global arithmetic ES receiving determinant — Turn 7 continuation
+
+## Established result
+
+At every positive integral Erdős–Straus witness at a prime p = 1 mod 12,
+the literal odd receiving numerator N=S^6 F is strictly negative and satisfies
+-N > (125873811/262144) p^8. At p = 1 mod 24 the constant improves to
+327448292668/47045881. The original coefficient-norm inverse satisfies
+||O^-1|| < 360 S^9/(c p^8).
+
+This closes the specific integral receiving-frame nonvanishing question in the
+supplied research-program audit. It removes that audit's three-character
+sufficient restriction. It is not a proof that an ES witness exists for every
+prime. An unfiltered, gate-failing divisor source can already have an invertible
+receiver; that negative control is retained.
+
+## Read and reproduce
+
+- `workbench.pdf` / `workbench.tex` and `core.tex`: complete arithmetic proof.
+- `preprint.pdf` / `preprint.tex`: three-page standalone note.
+- `certificates/polynomial_certificates.json`: complete universal integer arrays.
+- `certificates/states.json`: all original marked states in the declared range.
+- `MORPHISMS.md`: maps, inverse domains, signs, scale, metrics and lost data.
+- `verification.json`: observed commands, return codes, hashes and scope.
+
+Run Python 3.10 or later, with only the standard library:
+
+    python run_all.py --bound 3000 --directory certificates
+
+This runs both interpreter modes and a separate implementation. The main code
+expands exact multivariate polynomials. The separate checker uses full
+unisolvent grids with explicit degree bounds, so those grid tests prove entire
+polynomial identities. The distinct finite prime census is corroboration and
+is not extrapolated to universal ES occupancy.
+
+Build the PDFs, separately, with two runs of each command:
+
+    pdflatex -interaction=nonstopmode -halt-on-error workbench.tex
+    pdflatex -interaction=nonstopmode -halt-on-error preprint.tex
+
+## Handoff and scope
+
+`HANDOFF_TURN_7_REMAINDER.md` records the specific completed arithmetic question
+and the still-unproved universal original-coefficient existence statement.
+`source_reading.json` pins the inputs and records the limited content search.
+No historical-priority determination, independent mathematical review or Lean
+build is claimed. A local additive Git patch/bundle, when present, is not a
+remote pull request; see `publication_receipt.json`.
+
+The current package does not include private audit transcript payloads or a
+third-party paper PDF. Previous research is preserved separately in the
+cumulative handoff, not silently rewritten or re-audited.
